{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 674,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81d4d3cd98ae7696e3808ac9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "模特儿是模特儿，竞赛是竞赛，两者无关。\\n不要把它们混为一谈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5036f6a6db3a6c6f05a739879f1637c1cc642b1f4863c9f9132693d044660b80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "80"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b77af72aa3551355cad3fed7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵～你正摆出「怎么可能」的表情吧？\\n我就想看到那种表情呢──♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "86d992cf214173c5f301208010d504666f8c0fdd70f5ed0540c4852408e7d38b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "800"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebcc0d3edf6fc9a56845d56e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的家人们都有在看吗～～！！？\\n一起去痛快地大吃一顿美食吧～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05c8dfc57d32c8e762c0021be3691bade0d0fc54211c0399dddcee9a7a9efb46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "801"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:022a207ea82089bf57c0fea6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的很谢谢大家为我加油……！\\n你们的心情，都有好好地传达给我啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9f7024e4965d57ae01b08c07d04328fad8931d29264295a5f89f262fd165b24",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "802"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40b9752987388287702a6870",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我认为自己的表现，能为祖国和这个国家之间\\n开启一道崭新的历史大门……",
      "source_fingerprint": "38aced44747c92bba946dd717734cdb6dda8f24537a944c998e8fd4cf6ea12ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "803"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:298eef83d88f3695b2e62005",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那些欢呼声，还有大家的表情……我绝对\\n不会忘记这片景色。我获得了宝贵的回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5483e802275a7362117edf9d5f9a44782b0f1affbd61fe207c874fbf4086dc5e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "804"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d6fb546ab8da095da42c47c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想自己应该或多或少有带给大家\\n一场有趣的竞赛了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50d93096bb970da7b4810af1b81844b16bf6732c8040626c527b66549853215a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "805"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:857820948f0c25a35b16ce5b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "父亲、母亲……还有白仁。我们就全家一起去\\n吃顿饭，然后一边慢慢地聊吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5489d7ecc7c9b2506970c74caf4b2e9d8f9144445bab0bcd6b5a8a72e52fa4f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "806"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56275b580821ad46708a3c3f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就说人家会展现出最完美的飞行给你看！\\n跟我说的一样对吧，训练员♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84ba3c41f727ef824f11595672aa2ccf0fa700ce8d021c49ae290858b606aaae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "807"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20b6fed1d1508e502b9787e4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感谢大家的声援～☆谢礼是……啾♪\\n欸嘿嘿，这是感谢的着陆Kiss！",
      "source_fingerprint": "febacfc2ecf442e5d3fef24ee0d8709cb0fcb55f114191d6906fcb98dafc91fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "808"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:964dabbb247b53560ff31b5a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那道影子……看起来似乎更近了一点──\\n虽然它还是非常遥远……",
      "source_fingerprint": "29a4cadf7427697d8e1b634c3c78e5a2d6ed22e5633885664b9f7166db1d9089",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "809"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:109193cb4563a17d999f4330",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有的！姿态端正、声音洪亮且很有人望！\\n我从大家身上感受到了不输给我的班长之力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42b4fc1e71ef4fc1c9b61d8cbeec726d03e3352690be31bb7b6835758757674c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "81"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a9901bd2411fd77b2a8acad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在安静的场所一边喝着咖啡……\\n一边回味今天发生的事情并牢牢地记住……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dd1cbca2b88d02afd3b24105355d8115f52677f8bdb392e4c62a0b93bb086ad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "810"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ed74e8f979e85460a2d457c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感谢。我判断之所以能完成这次的任务，\\n是因为有教练在的缘故。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f12c0287a87ece028a59f9b175df6eed371158a4465b69f3cbb48e3a995d5ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "811"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cf0db3c5631d49d9b523a89",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "搜寻中……发生错误。\\n思考回路超过负荷，无法输出词汇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08400548b15d2f8149a4d0cb56a52eb960b49eae3f0b0fc400ed3b0cef1281f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "812"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5790bc11046ed2f11aba5cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我还不能代表目白家……\\n但很荣幸能以家族成员的身份上场表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4039e3492b0022d72ecf6d0dbef07addb36bda1ac374f2875bcb054d0918e73",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "813"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:627e9a7e01ac0685dde6622a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是你们呼唤「赖恩」的声音\\n推着我往前进的！谢谢大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "318449cd9dafef1400fc355fe7cf4e115614f35dadf017700189bca349a72436",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "814"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eec3acffc0a0c100b5aae2f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是举办一场庆功派对，然后\\n邀请很多人来品尝我做的料理吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7941fa75fae40fa6ff78f45c71ec6ed9fd024dc36c9e756609862bb870a860c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "815"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ba3381616e9178106bc03ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要和队伍成员一起举办胜利火锅派对～♪\\n希望同场竞赛的对手们也都能来参加呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "15f6b0511f7b4798651b93f323ada296b06d61e37eed272cfa50ed44adc8a200",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "816"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f66d44c6c3ac4f2f0f34f0e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能得到这么多人的祝福……真是太感激了……\\n感觉等一下走路会忍不住小跳步呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73e157f28ab764a23e6a946bb10e8927133888a147995ebc6511c2fa609cd934",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "817"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4023c2441d5418746f385591",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "盛冈的记者！刚才有看到我的表现吗！？\\n耶嘿嘿，故乡的大家应该都很惊讶吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a74134691532b0ca84d3a23d019691df4f24a27b75cd35cb98320f423f3b6527",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "818"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c8c8ecf1c00ad7543babae5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我……我……我好高兴。获胜后，\\n竟然能得到这么多人的祝福……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7ca6d5c010f530c18127d586aa6cf86866daed5c1eb61ebfb3790d3b26e2a2e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "819"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cdea4a63b49c3d6a82d2cad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是绕口令吧！塔滑汤洒汤烫塔！\\n爆爆进进爆进进！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ccaebf62222b0f97036b5dfde32008331e3c2b3e0a992f8759bcdf1d41e1285",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "82"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c06cfb786a5c9e225eeffca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "米浴尽力了……尽力了喔！\\n因为有大……有训练员在我身边的缘故！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77627d5cf85894a08465bfb39a935928be69e5168868f845efe9f53be384266f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "820"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97657d5aed7370ae45d1a5b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你这个人啊，看起来比我还开心耶！\\n呵呵，这就是你的优点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "481c296455e9f61bba0dd19ef4d86ab8747cda88a68d604e2bae30552515252e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "821"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fafb2da2b401ecce3d954aa9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有大家的笑容就足够了！反倒是我\\n想要和大家说声「谢谢你们的支持」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a10be10b08a01668efa81797dba991591c5f606af4efecbe4a4eff1602ce25cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "822"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63e9cef033d9389a166dcbb9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "怎么可能，只是再次理解「可能性永无止境」\\n而已。但光是这样就有其意义了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d8a91bd7d1b7b40c17524ef8a4af4a4123153e30f35b48d26156bbcc06c00c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "823"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df9abe799e1369a88abd984d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是下个实验的构思吧。好啦，因为我想\\n尽快着手进行准备，那就先失陪了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d90df791ff3c668d0d9cadb1d0f4f4e807bc2c151c6ac814c1c95fb6e81c2c96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "824"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a00156ee2f56ae8f7359e2c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我打算去观测星象。\\n若能在那里悠闲地观赏星星的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "af84e514d0e8f33a193c917ead8b5a1918e82ea000f0345b6be14cba5a728035",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "825"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6607aeb268fa82dc60160406",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……不过是相信自己的这双脚罢了。\\n就只有那样而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "671dd2fc018f07da4cc9082fe55cf81591be37f51345c95b5dfd455d362f4061",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "826"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae0f44a370957e5e8d9a2d5d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要看你懂不懂得人情义理！\\n神明大人最喜欢那样的家伙了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "67c2520da7b37e519f73ddddfdf1d696e8851633e1e0feae4d08822289acb7b1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "827"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4658b64e37ad0a558faf2dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不管哪条路都布满了荆棘呢。但跨越之后\\n绝景就在眼前！令人欲罢不能啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54f950b7d7eb7b31f1d2619bb283615ec2f8c09da754825d9a127d0b268fb698",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "828"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fdbe6bde346fea7de4199b5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呜，呜呜……谢谢大家！！\\n唔喔喔喔喔──！我好高兴喔──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90dde3f4b605d57cddc9e4e2f0835bd0b1902da3199d11ff80fabc851aa9dfd5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "829"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85146d8ef9bb0dd0dc337532",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "答案只有一个──every one。\\n全世界的赛马娘都是我的劲敌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb0a1e8516cc87f9423134c50f5e4ed2ea53856dec3b32b98ea2a214acaeda6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "83"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da3b0f709d5f01ca9c4c4954",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总觉得有股开心的感觉「碰──！！」地\\n突然涌上来……呃～我不太会形容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba329a092f448f38a4a70e004e3c2f40ca27ad4c32647b5f2658ff9189301009",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "830"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1d9c69d299eb59f25ecd442",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……嗯，还不错啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "931a08864e641f4ae9379b77c46cc5b372d490e96277766f9a267134182be721",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "831"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b7b90974320f32b92cf476b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "也没有什么话需要再说的啦……\\n反正你之后也一定会跟过来对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a98e13de099e52467d9be312780d734239688f671729707b34e84fc0aa1c160",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "832"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06dd547fd230df2c8b66b4d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要举办先前就已经规划好的庆功宴。因为相信\\n能办得成，所以有同时进行了准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad1e2aa37b1b57b76e09aaf01c6bad848da07609c41a1ca217b0568cc2e72413",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "833"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45b9494fb09de2f82375c32c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正因为有你的指导，才让我能顺利\\n完成了这份计划……Danke schön！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f82ec70728dbd8d290f73e10ae97b1f9436e20a19100998f1808f5d55b1772b7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "834"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58a05fcd437d8c036b971400",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为用一句话完全不足以表达\\n真机伶的感谢之意……所以后续请见UG☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9261402a6d792c1c2c0024d9a6518404be0fd46c72d255916d0e630122d606fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "835"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd9f5fe80db45a2f862ed2bc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "欸嘿♪因为真机伶今后会越来越可爱，\\n所以……不可以眨眼喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "734f71b671a3b5fa3e48280b44be199230be08d848d7a3e7db5c46a736d19215",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "836"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43a3236aa84577ce87da4f2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将来会和王子住进有练习赛道的城堡里……\\n咦？你不是要问这个？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cec3d90764b2898cb7af7f97f4bf6329a2aba281a04c9a8029c0afc213e6c2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "837"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2ed006dae09844ecbd45f46",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "还用问吗？那当然是──\\n友情、努力和毅力啰！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e45bb05ce695188e6663b05509bc1d6142330bd77416e17f7347155976ce7bcd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "838"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d34880e2fb71033c5c43eb8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哇，怎么办……呼，遇到这种真的很开心的\\n时刻，反而就是会说不出话来呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "286e1cf9eaa4b06df981690dafa99f9c77f157f8b4edb7f87db848146911a48a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "839"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9e46835120094a499e0d7e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我要立刻去会场附近买本地盒饭。\\n──呵呵，其实我已经想很久了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e34a6ecae7434757391d21523c544b52268651e132d57d15fd747c2068eee8db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "84"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f3f4c58b0a6643aff2ac145",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵……可以啊。不过要认真拍喔？\\n你会拍出一张最棒的照片对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "da12c5276e36bfc256bcaf35a23421e6cd90612fdc96ca0ab54b97a6a051ebef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "840"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ac4d152f88b0950994f0717",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "爆进、爆进、再爆进！！\\n这就是最佳的模范式作战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca8581fa76139219bd48342effc93a5dfd37a04a3d4529886c1f346972717550",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "841"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58e15f9b6432b835dc215126",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我今后会持续响应大家的期待！\\n因为我是大家的班长！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cb1797d38d8e21cced8224b1c7ff3519e37a95e29adde88a2d71cd921ad1601",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "842"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7257d2824851951d4ef67a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Of course，采珠狂欢祭就要开始啰。\\n何时？现在！let's dance!!",
      "source_fingerprint": "d05299c9e9b811a806da1e3cb909e6cc365d76ea9b649727c2f22413d217beaf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "843"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fda9bff22578446a10f985a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "──看到了吧？世界转变的瞬间。\\n好了，接下来轮到你啰，现在开始冲刺吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "819e005d013ffc116431a3beca6274f003738405ce8eb42584903c515b856057",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "844"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2946921938aea0438fd8a76c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "风风要让所有粉丝都看到！\\n大家一起赞颂风风吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ae4214035e5c51905d870f0c02f1da4d469ff07853268134d611f45bd190a4f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "845"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38f8637b174ec78b7edea126",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "风风想要三个人一起吃庆祝胜利的汉堡排啦！\\n而且要妈妈最拿手、最有嚼劲的那种！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76784744ffeb64534aed1ab70f366aac1cb1b4d075d9dae3c5e79fcdda1ccca2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "846"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d87229734ae2b820415c9e92",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对吧对吧！？哼哼──♪\\n我成为大魔女的日子就快到了喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5117d3e43db8f3b1b846cc748e58e4a7e5270b8bcf66d19fd9e1cbb72cec4ef5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "847"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a098c71d52fbfc85a4a3d083",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "祖母，我赢了喔！妈妈，你看见了吗！？\\n爸爸……买新的魔导书给我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d6ffc77d6002fb709fd32d827ce813d3479c3739013efa43cdbafa4fd8456f7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "848"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:679e71deba7f09a341668647",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是啊，我摸着大家的头说「好棒好棒」了♪\\n因为有大家的努力才会有这场胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "674630dd79157e5bc2953473110a0b7436aaa9780ee16d17cb0463629d25843e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "849"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db774f94fa8195803cde0fcf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "把超厚肉乾叠五层！\\n风风越咬就会越有活力啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c46f62ddadf502b83a29b5f1f1ee0a4cd9f38684fa5ce8c8b0b39accb3beaf96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "85"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beeb32af06c70fd1ba7475c8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很高兴能由我来证明了\\n你真的是个「很棒的孩子」……",
      "source_fingerprint": "237791b3c620d1c0ebda13646e5ae8f41be6840fd5c362f61dbbf480635dc484",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "850"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78e6f86f5b57a1f4be460b70",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子……会把心中满满的感谢之情，\\n全都投注在之后的演唱会上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e26834cef5ad3b1fd70e2a172fcbcc85a6a14ebd8da4e5a34b655f04646ee11a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "851"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f974ac88fe661c1cfcd2092",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛马娘偶像飞鹰子会用超全力载歌载舞！\\n所以请大家要声援飞鹰子超全力抵达终点喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "39e4f8b9dbdb8a53ddf51b3d6628c6ebce448a8dde85a4d3b52a84a7d1d94d5d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "852"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3fda8ffe11ec45c5bd14077",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咦、咦咦！？我、我想想喔……\\n「超越王道成为传说」……的「序章」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "925586e90fe4f3c4000bddae8a5495b0aea3b59e3d15d2f6e167d65749c464b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "853"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:996d10d5be7a60be1ac17705",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然都是一些很像英雄的人……不过，\\n今天，唯独今天！我才是、主角！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6dc1537041fa2f909d62333c180104e1be0fed5a67bb053ca340dbe6ceefb2b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "854"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0ddff630cbc030a9000d452",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "糟糕！超开心，是说情绪太嗨了吧！\\n怎么办！？只要比个「YA」就可以了吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dca969ee5458c354da31c4683cfdf46c6a723aa34f61c4cd26cf166fdc0cb064",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "855"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47927e9cd55fb23c04145ec2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真心感谢～！啊，是说我想把这段采访\\n传到Umatok上耶，可以吗～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69df43b8f45d6398df7ba7828043d826ec3b5f48151f397805775fbb8dfc6cff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "856"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10296608ebe0ab5ae9cbd3c7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是啊，非胜即败的极限对决……\\n我玩得很尽兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6aaf110b3f166d5cf77bacb47ebe4079e1c9dc197faadca537c522b16f74607",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "857"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c69a8f79ba51ae15373fe381",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "…………谁知道。\\n反正都会自己看比赛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d2debdf0393e881f13979d2f4ccc7beaf14d1b162a451e8f0920a6cde14e4f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "858"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:618e405c75069c7ba9716fa7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "老实说会觉得你们都是怪人耶。\\n……看吧。我就是只能说出这种话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a2ad1c635d73f3b57b6e59fac9d6dbfed9b46aa9f50387fa1c7b5e435b607ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "859"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77d466d96c09c47e6302421c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "风风会想像自己得到好多人的掌声啦！\\n怎么样？现在都成真了喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ec9cd64cc93873e4d92c6a7095ed062cba9c2a4651e8366319eef1b0b69fc12",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "86"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19c3c182c40f4df118b15a34",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然……我不打算特别做些什么，但身边的人\\n一定会盛大庆祝吧……唉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fc61367402f07be7ff2e1d4870838bd6d9cab822d7d20935d42a93a674ee80b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "860"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc29ff5f0a839d0dd54759c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会和队伍里的大家一起举办庆功宴，\\n这次我想挑战看看气泡果汁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00d0e796f162eec80bf96467887781d7744406c18500645b7f6daba1e9311c64",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "861"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3d384ac8eedae4526df1ea5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的目标是和大家一起同乐！\\n谢谢你们让我看到了美好的笑容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba659fd86f509e81feea84c03f59899d5811166675c7896c94f8439d410cb13",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "862"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d109f52b96909a493f9e504",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跟你说喔！我觉得暖呼呼、头昏昏的，\\n有种「哇──」的感觉！想一直一直跑下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ede3a93f3e3dac30e06b77e6fc38e92bacd167559b1e77ebf9bdc23cc4a1fef6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "863"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d81c2407712e81ccfd0fe700",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我现在超级开心的喔！\\n谢谢你让我参加好多竞赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3babd2b985a36264e8e11f64355267134cfb6f3878887fa3c13ae89f08c5a6cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "864"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8435c4206a4d741212d0dd3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最想先跟爸爸和训练员分享！\\n然后是妈妈跟教官……还有大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c03531727b149ffd929cd27a52e8582bf75d107494fa60f6642998b0f26f1903",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "865"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12097f011092e5e00424a7e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让我体验到最热血的对决……真的很感谢！！\\n我们是永远的劲敌喔！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93146f069b3214b03063b3d7259a3a49b139d6f60088b7947f5ac0daacb37d3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "866"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a4862f44e30bcf70f7545be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "どんな苦境も、乗り越えてみせるっ！\\n正義のヒーローは、絶対に諦めないからな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5f31ca8736732715051e1170cf4ff3f401bfd0dbf4a8dfe88db86f05cfb0a61",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "867"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:573ffced4c61eb7f27c7d628",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "愛と勇気と栄養を力に！\\nビコーペガサスの戦いは続く！　……へへ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "610261814c8704ddb3ac87e0ad88f0fe47de6d01484a5a907eef7aaaef1f099a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "868"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a639cfdd233d7e832f11be1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "世界变得更可爱了对吧？\\n这就是竞赛！这就是美丽☆★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "826f8dcdd465a5b20a79662a1a1518ea872da2fe8b051ee7dd1bbfddfca68cdd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "869"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:658889cccd60cc6b43762280",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不是魔咒，是、魔、法！\\n我可是咏唱了长达十五个小节的大魔法喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94312eb6444d1cf8af3e775120e23b937922ed44ff46e482570c8265db9b01f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "87"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfc4ba1e739e31214f00b415",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不是喔！这还只是刚开始！\\n我要让世界变得更加美丽哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f134bfeda70b06221674ce5ef1ab4e4770b7a7b1d969195766f580f8b399aba0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "870"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d9a0163c2fe6e9ee3c93e6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "笑家门～～～～！！呵、呵、呵！！\\n就是这样，你很懂嘛～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc6751b23efc40c486e4a5632dde28a840e7a84fe5e1b98e6393d2fa6e133404",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "871"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
